# Cairn — Google OAuth Client IDs
# Create separate OAuth 2.0 Web Client IDs in Google Cloud Console:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
#
# For each client ID, add these Authorized JavaScript Origins:
#   - http://localhost:5173
#   - http://localhost:5174
#   - https://your-production-domain.com
#
# Then copy this file to .env and fill in your values:

VITE_GOOGLE_BUYER_CLIENT_ID=your_buyer_oauth_client_id_here
VITE_GOOGLE_MERCHANT_CLIENT_ID=your_merchant_oauth_client_id_here
